                                "sense_id": "b61e795c-4f47-3aef-aead-5f34a3ae3014",
                                "text": "The sun had set the peak of Olympus all ashimmer."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "d3948eb4-57a0-4a38-a834-bd61d9979504",
                                "sense_id": "b61e795c-4f47-3aef-aead-5f34a3ae3014",
                                "text": "The solitary vessel was the only moving thing on the sea that morning when the east turned gray and the black water came ashimmer with silver light."
                            },
                            {
